{"title":"What message passing can and can't see","sub":"Information spreads one hop per layer; some structures it can never tell apart.","kind":"graph","interval":2600,"scenarioLabel":"Show","scenarios":[{"name":"Message passing","frames":[{"caption":"Node S starts with feature 1; every other node starts at 0. Each GCN layer replaces every node's value with a degree-normalized sum over itself and its neighbours: h ← Â h. (No weights or nonlinearity here, so we can watch the propagation itself.)","nodes":{"S":{"cls":"b","sub":"1.00"},"a":{"sub":"0"},"b":{"sub":"0"},"c":{"sub":"0"},"d":{"sub":"0"},"e":{"sub":"0"},"f":{"sub":"0"},"g":{"sub":"0"},"h":{"sub":"0"},"i":{"sub":"0"}},"edges":{},"stats":[["Layers",0],["Nodes reached","1 of 10"]]},{"caption":"After one layer, only S's direct neighbours have heard from it. A node's representation after k layers depends only on nodes within k hops: its receptive field.","nodes":{"S":{"cls":"b","sub":"0.33"},"a":{"cls":"a","sub":"0.29"},"b":{"cls":"a","sub":"0.29"},"c":{"sub":"0"},"d":{"sub":"0"},"e":{"sub":"0"},"f":{"sub":"0"},"g":{"sub":"0"},"h":{"sub":"0"},"i":{"sub":"0"}},"edges":{"S-a":"a","S-b":"a"},"stats":[["Layers",1],["Nodes reached","3 of 10"]]},{"caption":"Two layers: two hops.","nodes":{"S":{"cls":"b","sub":"0.28"},"a":{"cls":"a","sub":"0.17"},"b":{"cls":"a","sub":"0.17"},"c":{"cls":"a","sub":"0.08"},"d":{"cls":"a","sub":"0.13"},"e":{"cls":"a","sub":"0.08"},"f":{"sub":"0"},"g":{"sub":"0"},"h":{"sub":"0"},"i":{"sub":"0"}},"edges":{"S-a":"a","S-b":"a","a-c":"a","a-d":"a","b-d":"a","b-e":"a"},"stats":[["Layers",2],["Nodes reached","6 of 10"]]},{"caption":"Three layers. Information from S now reaches most of the graph.","nodes":{"S":{"cls":"b","sub":"0.19"},"a":{"cls":"a","sub":"0.18"},"b":{"cls":"a","sub":"0.18"},"c":{"cls":"a","sub":"0.08"},"d":{"cls":"a","sub":"0.10"},"e":{"cls":"a","sub":"0.08"},"f":{"cls":"a","sub":"0.05"},"g":{"cls":"a","sub":"0.05"},"h":{"sub":"0"},"i":{"sub":"0"}},"edges":{"S-a":"a","S-b":"a","a